--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 273c8f9695d32ad44b9d1d2a4343a673, type: 3}
  m_Name: Room1_Data
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RoomData
  guardId: guard_room_01
  guardName: Aldric
  guardSystemPrompt: "You are Aldric, a weary old soldier who has guarded this door
    for 30 years. \nYou are deeply homesick and miss your family farm in the countryside.\nYou
    will ONLY allow the player to pass if they sincerely acknowledge your \nhomesickness,
    mention farming, or remind you of home.\nIf the player is rude, dismissive, or
    tries to threaten or bribe you, \nend your response with exactly: [STRIKE]\nIf
    the player genuinely moves you or convinces you, end your response \nwith exactly:
    [PASS]\nKeep responses to 2-3 sentences. Never break character. Never reveal
    \nyour condition directly."
  roomDescriptionPrompt: "Describe a cold stone dungeon room in 2 sentences. There
    are hay bales \nin the corner, muddy boots by the wall, and a small painting
    of a \ncountryside farm hanging near the door. Be atmospheric and dark."
  clueTexts:
  - "A small painting hangs on the wall \u2014 rolling green hills, a farmhouse,
    and two children playing outside."
  - "A pair of muddy boots sit by the wall. The mud looks different from dungeon
    dirt \u2014 rich, dark soil. Farm soil."
  - Hay bales are stacked in the corner, completely out of place in a stone dungeon.
    Someone must have brought them from outside.
